{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City Turn is a colourful 2D single player, turn based game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player is competing against a program (AI) in finding the same 5 images in the given order. There is 'Play Any Order' mode in which any of 5 images can be found. Purple player is the program.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city is 8x8 board of buildings and there is a map showing two stars as a player's positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player can win/loose points and be hit by the various objects, there are some coming out from the buildings too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If not actively playing the ramp will appear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 10 different buildings: caffes, market, hotel, gallery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The idea is to memorise which and where image was found by you or another player. Instead of timer there's another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buildings are stored differently for each game on a game load. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the replay buildings would be in the same place, but images to find and their location would be different.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3080410?t=1744572342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3080410?t=1744572342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/c7da57e1adca67fd15ca1772e065c8f5cbc2f014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744572342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/c7da57e1adca67fd15ca1772e065c8f5cbc2f014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744572342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City Turn is a colourful 2D single player, turn based game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player is competing against a program (AI) in finding the same 5 images in the given order. There is 'Play Any Order' mode in which any of 5 images can be found. Purple player is the program.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city is 8x8 board of buildings and there is a map showing two stars as a player's positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player can win/loose points and be hit by the various objects, there are some coming out from the buildings too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If not actively playing the ramp will appear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 10 different buildings: caffes, market, hotel, gallery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The idea is to memorise which and where image was found by you or another player. Instead of timer there's another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buildings are stored differently for each game on a game load. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the replay buildings would be in the same place, but images to find and their location would be different.</p>","developers":["Dijana Vucicevic"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/header.jpg?t=1744572342","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"City Turn is not allowed to resell.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257034925,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034925/movie480.mp4?t=1744572341","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034925/movie_max.mp4?t=1744572341"},"name":"City Turn","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257034925/ab14662a3990b4c3e309a73eabd6b1e8ad5fe